
=== RIVER SYSTEM: Canberra ===

Connections:
  Googong                →  googongDam [DAM]
  googongDam [DAM]       →  Queanbeyan
  Queanbeyan             →  centralMongolo
  upperMongolo           →  Queanbeyan
  jerrabombarra          →  centralMongolo
  centralMongolo         →  burleyGriffinDam [DAM]
  burleyGriffinDam [DAM] →  lowerMongolo


=== RIVER SYSTEM MAP: Canberra ===

Googong (source)
  └──▶ googongDam [DAM]
    └──▶ Queanbeyan
      └──▶ centralMongolo [OUTLET]
        └──▶ burleyGriffinDam [DAM]
          └──▶ lowerMongolo [OUTLET]

upperMongolo (source)
  └──▶ Queanbeyan
    └──▶ centralMongolo [OUTLET]
      └──▶ burleyGriffinDam [DAM]
        └──▶ lowerMongolo [OUTLET]

jerrabombarra (source)
  └──▶ centralMongolo [OUTLET]
    └──▶ burleyGriffinDam [DAM]
      └──▶ lowerMongolo [OUTLET]



